- Binary v4.39.410.14 acquired from `repo.whale.naver.com/stable/deb/pool/main/n/naver-whale-stable/naver-whale-stable_4.39.410.14-1_amd64.deb`
- Full repo enumeration: 4 branches + 5 wiki pages + README.ko.md — 0 sync/crypto/OSCrypt source files in any public branch
