- OSCrypt async/legacy coexistence: Chromium 138 async OSCrypt + legacy Whale fork both present
- `utilityPrivate` manifest origin-binding gaps for `setSyncEncryptionKeys`/`retrieveTrustedVaultKeys` confirmed
- `authkey_fetcher.cc` Whale fork inside upstream identity_manager confirmed
